Low-poly subdivision-ready 3D model of Spitfire HF MK VII with PBR materials (Specular and Metallic workflows).Advantages of the model:
-You can change basecolor and metallic reflaction very easily-Clean geometry;

  - The model is maximally optimized for use in 3d games and VR;

  - Just one material and one set of textures for the whole model. This allows you to achieve maximum performance in games and real-time applications;

  - Very low polycount. The model without Subdivision modifier is great for mobile games. When you apply a Subdivision modifier, it starts to look great in large projects on PCs and game consoles as well. This is possible thanks to a very competent application of smoothing groups and properly adjusted geometry;

  - Real world scale (Metric / Centimeters). So you can import this model easily into your project without need to change anything;

  - The model uses smoothing groups, so you can always increase details to the required level simply by applying a subdivision modifier with a necessary number of iterations;

  - Divided into functional parts and grouped for easy editing and using in game engines;

  - The model consists of 30 separate objects grouped together. Each of these objects has a simple and understandable name;

  - UV map is maximally optimized for texture's easy editing so without difficulties you can add or remove any logo or some details where needed;

  - Specular and Metallic workflow textures included!

  - Compatible with the majority of modern game engines!

Model specifications:
Created in Blender 2.90.1 Model does not require installation of additional plug-ins or software. You need only Blender 2.80-2.90 to get the same rendering as on the preview image.

  - Polygons count: 15,263 (no n-gons)Subdivision 1 polygons count: 60,475Subdivision 2 polygons count: 563,316

  - Vertices count: 23,627

  - Unit Scale: Metric / Centimeters

Textures (Metallic workflow):

  - Base Color (4,096 x 4,096 PNG)

  - NormalMap (4,096 x 4,096 PNG)

  - HeightMap (4,096 x 4,096 PNG)

  - Metallic (4,096 x 4,096 PNG)

  - Roughness (4,096 x 4,096 PNG)

Model is available in the following formats:

  - BLEND

